gle Hidden MLP 2) RNN 3) DNN each Neural Net is processed in different ipynb files before combining it. DNN is my baseline model because I achieved my maximum accuracy of 88.53% while processing data with it and rank achieved in it is 1335 out of 9,803.","topics":[],"score":236961,"global_rank":87560},{"name":"shik3519/deep-learning","owner":"shik3519","html_url":"https://github.com/shik3519/deep-learning","stars":3,"forks":0,"watchers":0,"issues":0,"language":"Jupyter Notebook","description":null,"topics":["cnn-model","dataloader","pytorch"],"score":236957,"global_rank":87564},{"name":"ethancdaniel/iris-classification","owner":"ethancdaniel","html_url":"https://github.com/ethancdaniel/iris-classification","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Jupyter Notebook","description":null,"topics":[],"score":236951,"global_rank":87581},{"name":"Shivi1982/Deep-Learning-Generative-AI-Tutorial","owner":"Shivi1982","html_url":"https://github.com/Shivi1982/Deep-Learning-Generative-AI-Tutorial","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Jupyter Notebook","description":"This notebook is an attempt to deep dive into some key concepts of Deep Learning and Emerging field of Gen AI","topics":[],"score":236951,"global_rank":87597},{"name":"deleyeem/nosql-challenge","owner":"deleyeem","html_url":"https://github.com/deleyeem/nosql-challenge","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Jupyter Notebook","description":"NoSQL MongoDB","topics":["mongodb","nosql"],"score":236951,"global_rank":87608},{"name":"elbanic/summit_2020_demo","owner":"elbanic","html_url":"https://github.com/elbanic/summit_2020_demo","stars":0,"forks":1,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Jupyter Notebook","description":null,"topics":[],"score":236927,"global_rank":87643},{"name":"yiihuang/ds_job_analysis","owner":"yiihuang","html_url":"https://github.com/yiihuang/ds_job_analysis","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Jupyter Notebook","description":null,"top